    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"re-evaluate\" and \"find new meaning\"... that's just things people say to feel better. but there is no new meaning. i feel like i've played the whole game, i reached the final level, and now the screen is just blank. there's no more quests, no more upgrades, no reason to keep playing. it's just exhausted. i'm just so tired of the climb.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
